@startuml
' Status: Proposed
' Verified current behavior against:
' - src/portfolio_advisor/main.py
' - src/portfolio_advisor/DB_creation/database_create.py
' - src/portfolio_advisor/operations/xls_import_watch.py
' - src/portfolio_advisor/database/migrations/model_portfolio_dry_run.py
' - src/portfolio_advisor/database/migrations/model_portfolio_parallel.py
' - src/portfolio_advisor/database/migrations/shortlist_parallel.py
' - src/portfolio_advisor/database/migrations/shortlist_zero_null.py
' - src/portfolio_advisor/database/migrations/shortlist_classification_pair_mapping.py
' - tests/test_schema_v3_model_portfolio_migration.py
' - tests/test_xls_import_watch.py
' Proposed contract: docs/architecture/model-portfolio-consolidation-plan.md
' Governing proposal: docs/decisions/ADR-007-consolidate-model-portfolio-workflows.md
title Model-portfolio consolidation and cutover [Proposed]

hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 120

actor Operator
participant "WatchPaths wrapper\n(or manual CLI)" as Trigger
collections "Retained workbook\nand MNB PDF evidence" as Evidence
participant "Single model admission\ncommand" as Writer
database "portfolio_advisor.sqlite\nproposed operational authority" as Analytical
participant "Model + provenance +\ncorrection validators" as Validators
database "SQLite-API\nrecovery backup" as Backup
database "model_portfolio.sqlite\nfrozen legacy after cutover" as Legacy

box "Operator-controlled input boundary" #E8F4FF
Operator -> Trigger: supply stable workbook
Trigger -> Writer: request admission under watcher lock
end box

Writer -> Evidence: read bytes, sheet inventory, and SHA-256
Evidence --> Writer: immutable source identity and parsed rows
Writer -> Writer: validate headers, categories, date, identifiers,\nstable row identities, and prior admission

alt exact workbook and all bindings already admitted
    Writer -> Analytical: read matching immutable receipt
    Analytical --> Writer: exact replay confirmed
    Writer --> Trigger: NO-OP (no rows added)
else same date with changed bytes or bindings
    Writer --> Trigger: REJECT before mutation
else new valid model evidence
    Writer -> Backup: create and verify consistent recovery snapshot
    Backup --> Writer: recovery manifest and checksum
    Writer -> Analytical: BEGIN IMMEDIATE
    activate Analytical
    Writer -> Analytical: append source, sheet, snapshot, occurrences,\ntyped fields, metrics, lineage, and import receipt
    Writer -> Validators: validate candidate transaction state
    activate Validators
    Validators -> Analytical: integrity + foreign keys + installed schema
    Validators -> Analytical: stable lineage and all-date model projection
    Validators -> Analytical: all installed shortlist correction contracts

    alt model projection or provenance mismatch
        Validators --> Writer: FAIL CLOSED
        Writer -> Analytical: ROLLBACK
        Writer --> Trigger: rejection; workbook remains pending
    else shortlist evidence would change bound dataset
        Validators --> Writer: FAIL CLOSED pending separate authorization
        Writer -> Analytical: ROLLBACK
        Writer --> Trigger: no automatic correction inheritance
    else every gate passes
        Validators --> Writer: validated
        Writer -> Analytical: COMMIT
        Writer --> Trigger: database admission complete
        Trigger -> Evidence: move workbook after commit
        note right of Trigger
          The database transaction does not claim
          atomicity for this later filesystem move.
          A failed move is resumed by exact replay.
        end note
    end
    deactivate Validators
    deactivate Analytical
end

== Separately authorized cutover ==

Operator -> Trigger: quiesce watcher and verify no pending input
Operator -> Backup: create full cutover recovery package
Operator -> Analytical: apply approved authority epoch and shared default
Operator -> Legacy: freeze; do not delete or resume writes
note over Analytical, Legacy
  Current state remains legacy-authoritative until this
  separately approved transition completes all release gates.
end note

== Post-cutover recovery ==

alt software rollback after newer imports
    Operator -> Analytical: retain consolidated authority and receipts
    Analytical --> Operator: generate temporary validated flat compatibility export
    note over Operator, Legacy
      Never point old code at a stale frozen legacy file.
    end note
else damaged analytical store
    Operator -> Backup: restore latest verified analytical snapshot elsewhere
    Operator -> Evidence: replay later immutable admissions in order
    Evidence --> Operator: current state reconstructed and revalidated
end

@enduml
